# English, translated from the Czech source catalog (i18n/cs/auth.ftl, docs/design/I18N.md). Message IDs are the same
# as in Czech. The login pages of the Worker (api/src/auth/pages.ts). A message missing here falls back to Czech.

## Login pages of the Worker

auth-page-app = GLIDE MDT
auth-no-access-title = No access
auth-no-access-body = You are signed in, but this account has no active membership in any organization in GLIDE MDT. Ask your organization's administrator for access.
auth-no-access-other = Sign in with another account
auth-failed-title = Sign-in failed
auth-failed-body = The sign-in did not finish, for example because it expired or was opened twice. Nothing was stored.
auth-unavailable-title = The sign-in service is unavailable
auth-unavailable-body = The sign-in service could not be reached just now. Please try again in a moment.
auth-misconfigured-title = Sign-in is not set up
auth-misconfigured-body = Sign-in is not set up correctly on this server. Contact the application's administrator.
auth-retry = Try again
auth-done-title = Signed in again
auth-done-body = You can close this window. In the original window, click "Try again" and your unsaved changes will be stored.
